<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Hoare lowers Shell.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Hoare lowers Shell.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Transport and Trading Co Plc &amp; Trading Co Plc was cut to &quot;undervalued&quot; from &quot;buy&quot; at ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, market sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage declined comment.</p>
<p>The stock was down 5p at 421-1/2 by 1115 GMT in heavy volume of 12.1 million shares, making it the most active stock in the FTSE 100 index.</p>
<p>Shell shares hit a record 450p on July 4, up 23 percent from their level in mid April.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
